{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92864bdaa74c9ba12d99650abd1b44b0ec09d9815cb69e1f512cbc61c924b441",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ed09420383655172bad5a79606bdd7ca031f35d92c1eca1e91f7b555f532335",
      "text": "共同奏响的协奏曲",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d270004266091eb226245ae4f2c543f1e988e2eafdbc38683ba4a58199610402",
      "text": "联合练习……真的很棒呢，都筑先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd1e1ab1441a3eb7262eb2e158b9b79d1fd5e20ce3e6764796f36223713163d",
      "text": "嗯，我也这么觉得。\n感觉那份余韵至今还在心头呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1847cae4921949fb1fa07c3f708365f8bf2dd67defb97abfef52940e87333531",
      "text": "大家的歌声融为一体，\n仿佛能传达到无边无际的远方，那种感觉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1128299b5a0d01fb8682358fd0856a3b52b93f6a5594eee2095cca8c8c8f37",
      "text": "如果是一个人，肯定无法邂逅到吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:507d5ad73f91365ec1a895b8aac6357f9898ecee0a12fa3d3467ec869bbf3f1d",
      "text": "我深有同感。我认为正因为是和315 Production的大家\n在一起，才能孕育出这样的歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:facec7da720c80f4ce0c1e2abf2a1227d36a7f5b1b3d6229c862cec55e32ecc4",
      "text": "而且，在实际大家合唱过之后，\n也体会到了这首歌新的魅力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb545b226da88459e1eec91f22460e07a1d6eb98cba13f43ecc20fd856515c4",
      "text": "练习才刚刚开始呢……\n真期待接下来它会进化成什么样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54dee775b50edbb5e502daa004ba9b9b71bd779c6b514182e26c5f38a8a50804",
      "text": "这次演唱会，感觉大家的和声会编织出\n超越想象的歌曲……我有这种感觉哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48d4bb7f5b72814d81f6fa10436b05d1c017fa5d91e52a9a5cf7507b803c64a1",
      "text": "是的，必定如此。不仅是我们，\n对观众来说也一定会成为难以忘怀的一曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_013_22_5_06_013_22:5_06_013_22:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3844ff963ec09ee9191a4a3c4b2790deb0cc166122bcb7929ac3ccace3e4573",
      "text": "虽说如此，在正式演出前绝不能掉以轻心。\n为了呈现更美好的歌声，继续加强练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
